  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Blue Origin obligated $1B in federal contract money in FY2026 to date. Blue Origin has 13 awards so far and an average award size of $78.6M. Obligations are up 863.6% year over year. Blue Origin obligated $20K in FY21, $357K in FY22, $15.8M in FY23, $10.6M in FY24, and $106M in FY25 before jumping to $1B in FY26. The National Aeronautics and Space Administration bought $735M and the Department of Defense bought $287M in FY2026 to date. Guided Missile and Space Vehicle Manufacturing is Blue Origin's largest market at $744M, followed by Nonscheduled Chartered Freight Air Transportation at $278M and Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences at $399K. All figures are contract obligations except award-value figures noted elsewhere. Current-year totals are partial and represent fiscal year to date activity.",
